      *================================================================*
      * PROGRAM  : UTFEEWAI                                            *
      * TYPE     : UNIT TEST DRIVER                                    *
      * PURPOSE  : UNIT TESTS FOR FEEWAIVE (MAINTENANCE FEE WAIVERS)   *
      *================================================================*
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UTFEEWAI.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TESTPARM.
       COPY FWVPARM.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'INIT' TO TST-FUNCTION
           MOVE 'FEEWAIVE' TO TST-SUITE-NAME
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS

           PERFORM 1000-TEST-DDAP
           PERFORM 2000-TEST-AGE
           PERFORM 3000-TEST-OTHER-PRODUCTS
           PERFORM 4000-TEST-GLOBAL

           MOVE 'SUMM' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS
           STOP RUN.

       1000-TEST-DDAP.
           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP NOTHING QUALIFIES - FEE APPLIES RC 08'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 8 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE FWV-RETURN-CODE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 1500.00 TO FWV-MIN-BAL-CYC
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP MIN BALANCE EXACTLY 1,500 WAIVED MB'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'MB' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 1499.99 TO FWV-MIN-BAL-CYC
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP MIN BALANCE 1,499.99 NOT WAIVED' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'N' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 5000.00 TO FWV-AVG-BAL-CYC
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP AVERAGE BALANCE 5,000 WAIVED AB' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'AB' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 500.00 TO FWV-DIRECT-DEP-AMT
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP DIRECT DEPOSIT 500 WAIVED DD' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'DD' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 480.00 TO FWV-DIRECT-DEP-AMT
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP DIRECT DEPOSIT 480 NOT WAIVED' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'N' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 'Y' TO FWV-EMPLOYEE-FLAG
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP EMPLOYEE WAIVED EM' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'EM' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       2000-TEST-AGE.
      *    65TH BIRTHDAY ON THE BUSINESS DATE
           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 19610930 TO FWV-CUST-BIRTH-DATE
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP AGE 65 ON BUSINESS DATE WAIVED SR'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'SR' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 19611001 TO FWV-CUST-BIRTH-DATE
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP AGE 64 (BIRTHDAY TOMORROW) NOT WAIVED'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 64 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE FWV-CUST-AGE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 20030101 TO FWV-CUST-BIRTH-DATE
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP AGE 23 STUDENT WAIVED ST' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'ST' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 20020930 TO FWV-CUST-BIRTH-DATE
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP AGE 24 NOT A STUDENT' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'N' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       3000-TEST-OTHER-PRODUCTS.
           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 'DDPR' TO FWV-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 50000.00 TO FWV-REL-BALANCE
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDPR RELATIONSHIP 50,000 WAIVED RB' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'RB' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           MOVE 49999.99 TO FWV-REL-BALANCE
           MOVE 'Y' TO FWV-EMPLOYEE-FLAG
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDPR NO EMPLOYEE WAIVER, REL 49,999.99 FEE'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 8 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE FWV-RETURN-CODE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 'MMKT' TO FWV-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 2400.00 TO FWV-MIN-BAL-CYC
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'MMKT MIN BALANCE 2,400 FEE APPLIES' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'N' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVE-FLAG TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           MOVE 2500.00 TO FWV-MIN-BAL-CYC
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'MMKT MIN BALANCE 2,500 WAIVED MB' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'MB' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 'SVST' TO FWV-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 250.00 TO FWV-CURRENT-BAL
           MOVE 'Y' TO FWV-HAS-DDAP-FLAG
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'SVST 250 WITH LINKED CHECKING WAIVED LK'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'LK' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           MOVE 'N' TO FWV-HAS-DDAP-FLAG
           MOVE 300.00 TO FWV-CURRENT-BAL
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'SVST BALANCE 300 WAIVED MB' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'MB' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

       4000-TEST-GLOBAL.
           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 20260915 TO FWV-OPEN-DATE
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'OPENED IN THIS CYCLE WAIVED NW' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'NW' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 'PW' TO FWV-CUST-SEGMENT
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'PRIVATE WEALTH ALWAYS WAIVED PW' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'PW' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-DDAP-BASE
           MOVE 'HYSV' TO FWV-PRODUCT-CODE
           CALL 'FEEWAIVE' USING FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'PRODUCT WITHOUT FEE RETURNS NF' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'NF' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE FWV-WAIVER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ.

      *    41-YEAR-OLD RETAIL CUSTOMER, OPENED 2022, NOTHING QUALIFIES
       8000-DDAP-BASE.
           INITIALIZE FEEWAIVE-PARMS
           MOVE 'DDAP' TO FWV-PRODUCT-CODE
           MOVE 20260930 TO FWV-BUSINESS-DATE
           MOVE 20220310 TO FWV-OPEN-DATE
           MOVE 20260831 TO FWV-CYCLE-START-DATE
           MOVE 410.00 TO FWV-MIN-BAL-CYC
           MOVE 900.00 TO FWV-AVG-BAL-CYC
           MOVE 640.00 TO FWV-CURRENT-BAL
           MOVE 0 TO FWV-DIRECT-DEP-AMT
           MOVE 0 TO FWV-REL-BALANCE
           MOVE 'RT' TO FWV-CUST-SEGMENT
           MOVE 19850412 TO FWV-CUST-BIRTH-DATE
           MOVE 'N' TO FWV-EMPLOYEE-FLAG
           MOVE 'N' TO FWV-HAS-DDAP-FLAG.

       9000-NEQ.
           MOVE 'NEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.

       9100-AEQ.
           MOVE 'AEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.
